  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "Échangez vos Vis Colorées contre\ndes Naricâlines ! <U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00C9006300680061006E00670065007A00200076006F0073002000560069007300200043006F006C006F007200E90065007300200063006F006E007400720065000A0064006500730020004E006100720069006300E2006C0069006E0065007300200021002000100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Salut ! Si t’as des Vis Colorées, je peux te les\néchanger contre des Naricâlines ! Ça te dit ?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ça me dit !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00C700610020006D00650020006400690074002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Non, ça ira.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F006E002C002000E700610020006900720061002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Y paraît que la Naricâline Rouge permet de\ngagner plus de Points d’Expérience !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Y paraît que la Naricâline Dorée permet de gagner\nplus d’argent !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00590020007000610072006100EE007400200071007500650020006C00610020004E006100720069006300E2006C0069006E006500200044006F007200E900650020007000650072006D006500740020006400650020006700610067006E00650072000A0070006C007500730020006420190061007200670065006E0074002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Y paraît que la Naricâline Rose permet\nd’obtenir plus de Méga-Fragments !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00590020007000610072006100EE007400200071007500650020006C00610020004E006100720069006300E2006C0069006E006500200052006F007300650020007000650072006D00650074000A00642019006F006200740065006E0069007200200070006C007500730020006400650020004D00E900670061002D0046007200610067006D0065006E00740073002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Y paraît que la Naricâline Verte permet de mieux\nrésister aux capacités des Pokémon !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1076,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Y paraît que la Naricâline Bleue permet de\ncapturer les Pokémon plus facilement !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Finalement tu veux pas ?\nPourquoi tu viens me parler, alors ?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00460069006E0061006C0065006D0065006E00740020007400750020007600650075007800200070006100730020003F000A0050006F0075007200710075006F00690020007400750020007600690065006E00730020006D00650020007000610072006C00650072002C00200061006C006F007200730020003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Attends ! T’as des Naricâlines de toutes les sortes\nmaintenant, j’me trompe ?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nDans ce cas, apporte-moi TOUTES les Vis Colorées\nrestantes, et je t’offrirai un cadeau spécial :<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nune Naricâline géante !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 205
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Il reste encore <U+0010><U+0002>ȁ<U+0004> Vis Colorée<U+0010><U+0003>ᄁ<U+0004>Ās !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nApporte-les toutes et je te les échangerai\ncontre une Naricâline géante !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1948,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 118
    },
    {
      "displayText": "T’as récupéré toutes les Vis Colorées ! Énorme !\nLa Naricâline géante est à toi !<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nJe te la livre directement chez toi !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 123
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La Naricâline géante a été envoyée\ndans votre chambre à l’Hôtel Z !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C00610020004E006100720069006300E2006C0069006E00650020006700E90061006E0074006500200061002000E9007400E900200065006E0076006F007900E90065000A00640061006E007300200076006F0074007200650020006300680061006D006200720065002000E00020006C2019004800F400740065006C0020005A002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pourquoi t’es encore là ?\nJ’ai plus de Naricâlines à échanger, hein.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006F0075007200710075006F00690020007420190065007300200065006E0063006F007200650020006C00E00020003F000A004A20190061006900200070006C007500730020006400650020004E006100720069006300E2006C0069006E00650073002000E0002000E9006300680061006E006700650072002C0020006800650069006E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Reviens me voir quand t’auras trouvé d’autres\nVis Colorées !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00520065007600690065006E00730020006D006500200076006F006900720020007100750061006E006400200074201900610075007200610073002000740072006F0075007600E9002000642019006100750074007200650073000A00560069007300200043006F006C006F007200E900650073002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Des objets à l’effigie de Narica en veux-tu,\nen voilà !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0044006500730020006F0062006A006500740073002000E00020006C201900650066006600690067006900650020006400650020004E0061007200690063006100200065006E00200076006500750078002D00740075002C000A0065006E00200076006F0069006C00E0002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ce sont des peluches d’Ohmassacre.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043006500200073006F006E00740020006400650073002000700065006C00750063006800650073002000642019004F0068006D0061007300730061006300720065002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En combat Pokémon comme dans les jeux vidéo,\nl’âge, ça compte pas !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nLes enfants peuvent battre les adultes et gagner\ndes récompenses !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 3016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 138
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Demande toujours un devis par écrit !\nLes accords verbaux, c’est du vent !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 3292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "On dirait pas, mais ça demande beaucoup\nde précision de colorer ces vis !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 3444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F006E00200064006900720061006900740020007000610073002C0020006D006100690073002000E70061002000640065006D0061006E00640065002000620065006100750063006F00750070000A0064006500200070007200E90063006900730069006F006E00200064006500200063006F006C006F00720065007200200063006500730020007600690073002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Le but de nos parcours d’obstacles, c’est d’égayer\nl’quotidien de la population d’Illumis !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Par ma barbe, c’est l<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿ܅e roia reine du Nari-Quiz ! T’as ce\nqui faut pour incarner l’hologramme de Narica !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 114
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Au départ, l’hologramme, c’était pour protéger\nNarica des fans trop enthousiastes...<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nMais j’ai fini par m’prendre au jeu !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 4012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 130
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Les Vis Colorées, c’est une façon d’nous amuser !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nÇa donne aussi un peu de charme à not’ ville\net la rend inoubliable !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 4272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 127
    },
    {
      "displayText": "On dirait qu’on va avoir du boulot pendant\nun p’tit moment !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 4528,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F006E00200064006900720061006900740020007100752019006F006E002000760061002000610076006F0069007200200064007500200062006F0075006C006F0074002000700065006E00640061006E0074000A0075006E0020007020190074006900740020006D006F006D0065006E00740020002100100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Faut qu’le monde entier admire mes parcours\nd’obs... Je veux dire, les exploits de ma p’tite fille !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 4660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 105
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’ai des fans qui adorent mon hologramme et\nje sais pas comment je dois le prendre...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 4872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Albia, elle est du genre à subir les choses sans\njamais se plaindre et je l’adore...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 5052,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Dis donc, t’arrêtes de regarder mon écran ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 5232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00440069007300200064006F006E0063002C00200074201900610072007200EA0074006500730020006400650020007200650067006100720064006500720020006D006F006E002000E9006300720061006E0020003F001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Les gens vont pas kiffer d’apprendre que tu te\nsoucies pas de la Tour Prismatique...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 5328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je veux rendre Illumis plus fun avec les Digi-Z4P !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 5508,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A006500200076006500750078002000720065006E00640072006500200049006C006C0075006D0069007300200070006C00750073002000660075006E002000610076006500630020006C0065007300200044006900670069002D005A0034005000200021001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
